            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.25.12+EZK.25.13+EZK.25.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 25:12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo Obadiya yeretswe. Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize ku vy’Abanyedomu. Twumvise inkuru zivuye k’Uhoraho, kandi har’ intumwa itumwe ku mahanga, ngo Ni muhaguruke, natwe nyene dukūre hasi, tubatere, tuje mu ntambara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rāba, nakugize ritoya ku yandi mahanga: uba inkengerwa rwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubgibone bgo mu mutima wawe bgaraguhenze, wewe uba mu bitandara vyacitsemw’ ibihoro, ukīvyagirira hejuru iyo bigwa; wewe uvugira mu mutima wawe, uti Ni nde yonkororera hasi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naho wodūga intumbgejuru nk’inkukuma,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "inkukuma ni yo mpungu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi naho wokwārika icāri cawe hagati y’inyenyeri, nzogukorora ngukūreyo, ni k’Uhoraho agize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.49.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 49:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.49.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.41.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 41:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe kuntu ugeseye! Ibisuma vyokūzira, cank’ abambuzi mw ijoro, mbega ntibogusahura kugeza bīhāgije gusa? Cank’ abāmūzi b’inzabibu boza kuri wewe, mbega ntibosigaza uduhūmbga tw’inzabibu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe kuntu ivya Esau bisesanguwe! Itunga ryiwe ryari rinyegejwe ukuntu risokorowe! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo mwari mwifatanije bose bāragusohoye, bagushitsa no ku rubibe: abo mwari mwuzuye baragusutse, none barakunesheje; abo wagaburira bāguteze umutego: ariko ntiwabimenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.29.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 29:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbega kur’ uwo musi sinzorandura abanyabgenge bo muri Edomu, ngaherengeteza amakenga ku musozi wa Esau? ni k’Uhoraho abaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "OBA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.1.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Am 1:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewe Temani, abahizi bawe bazogwa igihumura, bitume abantu bose iyo bava bakagera baririkwa, bashire ku musozi wa Esau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "OBA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "OBA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
